  "summary": "Skye Kakoschke-Moore, a senator with the Nick Xenophon Team, said she will step down after receiving advice that she holds British citizenship by descent through her mother. She said the discovery was unexpected and upsetting because her family had previously been told she was not eligible. Her mother was born in Singapore under British rule, later becoming a British citizen, which passed to Kakoschke-Moore after her birth in Darwin. She plans to seek a high court ruling on how the Senate vacancy should be handled and said she hopes to return to parliament. Nick Xenophon said the party was deeply saddened and noted uncertainty over whether the seat would be resolved through a recount, though such a process could potentially elevate NXT candidate Tim Storrer."
}
```

